    "web.textLabel": "Text",
    "web.intro": "TaigiKeyboard is a free, open-source Taiwanese typing tool, its typing engine developed by Taiwanese people themselves. TaigiKeyboard is free forever, with no ads and no paid features ever. Everyday users, students, teachers, schools and Taiwanese-language education groups are all free to use it. The hope is that writing and teaching Taiwanese comes with no extra burden.\n\nTaigiKeyboard for the web currently supports computers only. Switch to an English input method and you can start typing Taiwanese, with no Taiwanese input method to install.\n\nThis text can be deleted, and the title changed too. The settings are in the sidebar on the left: type in Tâi-lô or Pe̍h-ōe-jī, and adjust the dictionaries, shortcuts, the candidate window's look and its colours. Your text stays after the page is closed, so it works as a scratch pad; download it when you want to keep it.\n\nKeeping TaigiKeyboard running takes a lot. If it helps you, sponsorship is welcome: your support gives me the strength to keep working for Taiwanese.\n\nBîn-hiân",
